	Your only way down beyond the first level of Hell, which is the
level below the castle level, is to level teleport.
	You need two things - teleport control (ring or intrinsic) and
level teleporting capability (traps, cursed scrolls of teleportation)
to be able to level teleport to any desired level.
	I think the spoiler suggests level teleporting down to Level 50
which is the lowest level and then working your way up. All the levelas
in Hell are maze levels. They also have only one staircase (up). The 
Wizard is somewhere in these levels. The spoiler has more info. on this
AND also Vlad's tower. You can't dig in any of the levels of Hell. I mean
dig through the floor or the boundaries.
	What I generally do, is to find level teleport traps in the 
levels before the castle level. There are generally two or three around.
Use one to go down to level 50 and then come back all the way up, without
killing the wizard. This serves to map out aall the levels of Hell so that
when you go down next time (teleport to the Wiz's level), kill the wiz and
grab the Amulet, you can make a quick getaway. This requires two level 
teleport traps or scrolls. 
	BTW, you can gain intrinsic teleport control by eating tengus. Takes
sometime, but patience pays.
